    "description": {
     "value": "<p>On a hit with Nue, you can spend Cursed Energy up to your proficiency bonus to both deal an additional 1d8 lightning damage and increase the save DC by 1 per CE spent. A creature that fails its save against Nue's electrified wings with this boosted attack also has disadvantage on Strength and Dexterity saves for 1 minute and can repeat the save at the beginning of their turns. If you spend at least 3 cursed energy, the target is also stunned until the beginning of their turn on a failed save.</p>",
